)]{

Like @racket[fl+], @racket[fl-], @racket[fl*], @racket[fl/], and @racket[flabs],
but for @tech{extflonums}.}

@deftogether[(
@defproc[(extfl=   [a extflonum?] [b extflonum?]) boolean?]
